IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-ZMM-KV.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-HEADS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 HEAD-DIM            PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 VECTOR-BYTES-DIV64  PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 ZMM-LANES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-ZMM.
    IF NUM-HEADS == 0 OR HEAD-DIM == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-HEADS TO ZMM-LANES.
    MULTIPLY HEAD-DIM BY ZMM-LANES.
    DIVIDE 32 INTO ZMM-LANES.

    MOVE ZMM-LANES TO VECTOR-BYTES-DIV64.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-HEADS.
    WEIGHT 30 ZMM-LANES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
